      "source": [
        "## Regressão Logística (Features Reduzidas)\n",
        "\n",
        "Vamos agora treinar e avaliar o modelo de Regressão Logística utilizando apenas o conjunto de features `V1-V28` e `Amount_scaled` (`X_reduced`).\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 1000
        },
        "id": "9f60209e",
        "outputId": "8ffdc9da-d5c5-4b17-a322-7c5665646399"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "Fitting Logistic Regression model (reduced features)...\n",
            "Logistic Regression model (reduced features) fitted.\n",
            "\n",
            "Classification Report (Regressão Logística - Features Reduzidas):\n",
            "              precision    recall  f1-score   support\n",
